1411
00:59:32,210 --> 00:59:34,040
Please choose one of the cards.

1412
00:59:40,150 --> 00:59:41,780
- See you tomorrow. Good night.
- Bye.

1413
00:59:41,780 --> 00:59:42,820
Good night.

1414
00:59:45,390 --> 00:59:46,450
Kwak Beom.

1415
00:59:57,600 --> 00:59:59,430
Please choose one of the cards.

1416
00:59:59,430 --> 01:00:00,500
I choose this one.

1417
01:00:00,570 --> 01:00:02,570
You have chosen this card.

1418
01:00:02,570 --> 01:00:03,940
(All players have chosen a room
for Round 1.)

1419
01:00:03,940 --> 01:00:06,240
(All have been quarantined
in each location.)

1420
01:00:06,240 --> 01:00:08,880
Seung Yong seems like a citizen.

1421
01:00:15,250 --> 01:00:17,590
Nighttime for Round One has ended.

1422
01:00:18,150 --> 01:00:21,320
Please take off the blindfold
in your seat.

1423
01:00:27,830 --> 01:00:30,130
Here's the result of last night.

1424
01:00:31,270 --> 01:00:32,330
Don't tell me.

1425
01:00:32,630 --> 01:00:33,700
Last night,

1426
01:00:35,140 --> 01:00:37,340
nothing happened.

1427
01:00:40,070 --> 01:00:42,340
Nothing happened.

1428
01:00:49,680 --> 01:00:50,990
It didn't matter anymore.

1429
01:00:50,990 --> 01:00:52,490
Who the killer is
and who the citizens are.

1430
