1440
01:01:16,410 --> 01:01:19,250
Only then will the pickpocket succeed
in robbing,

1441
01:01:19,250 --> 01:01:22,050
and the killer succeed in killing.

1442
01:01:22,520 --> 01:01:24,590
However, the pickpocket...

1443
01:01:24,950 --> 01:01:27,490
