1444
01:01:27,490 --> 01:01:29,320
What's more,
the pickpocket has to survive.

1445
01:01:31,960 --> 01:01:34,400
I was totally lost.

1446
01:01:35,400 --> 01:01:37,530
Jin Ho was very supportive of the plan...

1447
01:01:37,970 --> 01:01:40,670
Seung Yong came up with...

1448
01:01:40,870 --> 01:01:42,570
