so they wouldn't pick Room E.

1480
01:03:20,500 --> 01:03:23,170
I thought, "Okay, I might pull this off."

1481
01:03:23,170 --> 01:03:25,910
"There's still a chance. Let's do it."

1482
01:03:26,670 --> 01:03:29,810
Daytime for Round Two has arrived.

1483
01:03:30,650 --> 01:03:33,550
You may freely move around for 30 minutes.

1484
01:03:35,720 --> 01:03:38,120
Why did Sung Joo buy an item
all of a sudden?

1485
01:03:38,890 --> 01:03:42,260
I thought Sung Joo was acting differently
from usual,

1486
01:03:42,260 --> 01:03:45,690
