1487
01:03:45,790 --> 01:03:47,230
(Round 2, Day Phase)

1488
01:03:47,230 --> 01:03:49,800
Sung Joo, did you buy an item?

1489
01:03:50,100 --> 01:03:51,700
- What?
- Did you buy an item?

1490
01:03:53,730 --> 01:03:55,540
Wait, where are you...

1491
01:03:55,540 --> 01:03:56,640
Why are you changing the subject?

1492
01:03:56,640 --> 01:03:58,270
Where did you sleep? No, they all...

1493
01:03:58,270 --> 01:03:59,670
Saying anything...

1494
01:03:59,810 --> 01:04:01,140
won't do me any good.

1495
01:04:01,140 --> 01:04:04,280
- When we're all here...
- What's your question?

1496
01:04:04,280 --> 01:04:06,710
- We talked about the game together.
- Yes.

1497
01:04:06,710 --> 01:04:08,580
You didn't say anything about items,

1498
01:04:08,580 --> 01:04:11,490
and you bought one out of nowhere,
so it's weird.

1499
01:04:11,950 --> 01:04:13,220
I know that you'd be...

1500
01:04:13,220 --> 01:04:14,920
