1507
01:04:26,330 --> 01:04:27,400
The fact that I went there out of nowhere?

1508
01:04:27,570 --> 01:04:28,770
The fact that I went there
out of nowhere...

1509
01:04:28,770 --> 01:04:30,340
and how you just dodged my question.

1510
01:04:31,070 --> 01:04:32,810
He's not the type...

1511
01:04:32,810 --> 01:04:34,380
