3526
02:31:46,940 --> 02:31:49,100
Jeong Keun Woo...

3527
02:31:51,910 --> 02:31:52,980
Darn it.

3528
02:31:55,080 --> 02:31:58,050
- You have chosen Jeong Keun Woo.
- Yes.

3529
02:31:58,150 --> 02:31:59,750
I'm very pragmatic.

3530
02:31:59,750 --> 02:32:00,950
So it wasn't hard to choose.

3531
02:32:00,950 --> 02:32:03,150
From the start, I've thought to myself...

3532
02:32:03,150 --> 02:32:04,820
